@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 225
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 75
skinparam ranksep 90
hide circle
hide empty members
package "预结算办理及患者选择" as C {
' @reference patient
class "患者" as patient_c <<entity>>
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_c <<entity>>
' @reference bill
class "应收账目" as bill_c <<entity>>
' @reference insurance_identity
class "医保身份核验" as identity_c <<entity>>
' @reference insurance_case
class "医保就诊办理" as previous_case_c <<entity>>
class "医保就诊办理" as insurance_case <<entity>> {
 唯一业务号、机构及诊断标识
 费用版本、办理状态及结果依据
 预估基金／个账／其他自付
 患者选择及确认时间
 --
 +核对患者就诊身份及账目归属()
 +核对本次费用范围及适用条件()
 +保存预估分摊(平台实际结果)
 +使旧预估失效(变更依据)
 +记录患者实际选择()
 +建立重新办理(原办理依据)
}
patient_c "1" -- "0..*" insurance_case
visit_c "1" -- "0..*" insurance_case
bill_c "0..1" -- "0..*" insurance_case
identity_c "0..1" -- "0..*" insurance_case
previous_case_c "原办理\n0..1" -- "0..*" insurance_case
patient_c -[hidden]right- visit_c
visit_c -[hidden]right- bill_c
note bottom of insurance_case
同一提交范围：总费＝预估基金＋个账＋其他自付，均非负。
范围外自费另列；预估不抵最终待付，也不算正式到账。
费用版本或适用条件变化，原预估失效并保留依据。
患者选择医保后才能正式结算，未决定或自费不自动结算。
end note
}
@enduml
